====International players====
International players that had declared this year and didn't previously declare in another prior year can also drop out of the draft about 10 days before the draft begins on June 13. Initially, there were 46 players that expressed interest in entering the 2016 draft. However, at the end of June 13, there were 33 international prospects that, for one reason or another, declined entry to the 2016 NBA draft, leaving only 13 international candidates for the event.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.draftexpress.com/article/Official-2016-NBA-Draft-Early-Entry-Withdrawal-List-Released-by-NBA-5563/|title=DraftExpress: Official 2016 NBA Draft Early-Entry Withdrawal List Released by NBA|access-date=June 24, 2016|archive-date=June 18, 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160618075855/http://www.draftexpress.com/article/Official-2016-NBA-Draft-Early-Entry-Withdrawal-List-Released-by-NBA-5563/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.nba.com/2016/news/06/15/early-entry-candidates-withdraw-2016-draft/index.html?ls=iref:nba:draft:headlines|title=Thirty-three international early-entry candidates withdraw from Draft|first=Official|last=Release|website=[[NBA.com]]|access-date=June 24, 2016}}</ref> That left the overall number of underclassmen entering the draft as 72.
